{"id":202,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><style>@font-face{ font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"宋体\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Wingdings\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Calibri\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Arial\";} p.MsoNormal{ mso-style-name:正文; mso-style-parent:\"\"; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:Arial; font-size:10.5000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} span.10{ font-family:'Times New Roman';} span.msoIns{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single; color:blue;} span.msoDel{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:line-through; color:red;} table.MsoNormalTable{ mso-style-name:普通表格; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ margin-top:72.0000pt; margin-bottom:72.0000pt; margin-left:90.0000pt; margin-right:90.0000pt; size:595.3000pt 841.9000pt; vsb_temp:15.6000pt; mso-header-margin:42.5500pt; mso-footer-margin:49.6000pt;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style><div><p>材韵传声，不负韶华；音为有你，声动校园。为搭建展现音乐才华与个人风采的舞台，丰富学生课余生活，丰富课余文化生活，释放蓬勃朝气，12月21日晚19时，材料科学与工程学院文艺部主办的“材韵传声，不负韶华”主题校园歌手大赛在09302H教室隆重举行。材料学院各部门部长受邀担任本次大赛评委，与现场师生共同见证这场音乐盛宴。<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nlQKkoR6knzTVLONLbnzfVU8l4nmMxRnl7ZL8QVnRn2Umv0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hRMShRLYyYoR7inlLiL4v8U46kLm7YnmQRLRNPMzlsUzMFnz-bLNC4nznFLlrkLlLJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYLz9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17218&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2C5C32815EC5374C7B212F6C091557A3/E292F3E4/1EB1C\" vheight=\"369\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nlQKkoR6knzTVLONLbnzfVU8l4nmMxRnl7ZL8QVnRn2Umv0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hRMShRLYyYoR7inlLiL4v8U46kLm7YnmQRLRNPMzlsUzMFnz-bLNC4nznFLlrkLlLJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYLz9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17218&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>伴随着观众热烈的掌声，大赛正式拉开帷幕。比赛中，选手们精神饱满、深情演绎，或婉转悠扬、或激昂高亢，一首首经典曲目与原创作品轮番上演，用歌声传递青春态度，用旋律诠释音乐热爱。灵动的歌声萦绕耳畔，真挚的情感感染全场，台下观众沉浸其中，不时响起阵阵掌声与欢呼声。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/U4CKZUNUbnRGaoOzVVnRLbU4UZMm9x8L478ozT2L8lYM770gihFp2hmCIa0MkyPnShRMSybMmQ2o7MkL7nVnNrVUmWfU4CDoRU4UmW7UzQFLRCDnRCPoRAFM7rfU4UJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYLz9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17218&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/41EC5966F8CB0DEFEEB2AC66843B2DA6/066D6188/4EAC4\" vheight=\"367\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/o7lKYozUYMzTkUO8W7MmG4nl-PM8rxkLl7aU8lPnl-ZLRN0gihFp2hmCIa0M1ysoShVM1y8L7lYM8VVUmlbU8MRnRfVLR6VMzNYnm9ZozrFnlLZLznVMRrFLzUZoRLbgjfJQ4Oeo4xmp2xZ_I6m_dN0qIbtpYyPLmLsg47sLm7ZgtA8pUJcc&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17218&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>经过多轮精彩比拼，大赛获奖名单正式揭晓：查燎原、刘伟康斩获一等奖；张博涵、杨博文荣获二等奖；邱锦浩、王爽、吕晓语、尚思旭拿下三等奖；贾逸凡、蔺彦军、张潇艺、朱梓莘获评优秀奖。评委们为获奖选手颁发荣誉证书与奖品，对他们的精彩表现给予充分肯定。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/M8MKfnm-anmlaMOR9PozQ2U4l4Umnx7U8VfLlV2LRW7Uz90gihFp2hmCIa0LYh7M1yZUSyYnllsLR7PL778LRC4MzfVnN7bUl7PozNinNMFM47Zo7L4MNQFM7CYnz7Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYLz9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17218&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3D68A2EE70110A406350EFA9AA1995FC/7188C36F/4F2E1\" vheight=\"367\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nR6K7M8-PnRCZUOmQRoR9iLmGbol7xPLzLPozlinm9YMzU0gihFp2hmCIa0okhfL1yaL1hfMmQVolQVLlU4LNlYUNMRnlQRoRr7MR9DU4WFLmnVMRQ7LlWFLzU8nlVRgjfJQ4Oeo4xmp2xZ_I6m_dN0qIbtpYyPLmLsg47sLm7ZgtA8pUJcc&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17218&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>悠扬歌声余韵未散，美好时光定格此刻。本次“材韵传声，不负韶华”校园歌手大赛在欢乐与感动中圆满落下帷幕。此次大赛不仅为材料学院学子提供了展现自我的平台，更彰显了当代大学生的青春活力与精神风貌，为校园文化生活增添了鲜活亮丽的色彩。愿音乐常伴校园，愿青春不负韶华，我们下次再会！</p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://3y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=/nlQKkoR6knzTVLONLbnzfVU8l4nmMxRnl7ZL8QVnRn2Umv0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hRMShRLYyYoR7inlLiL4v8U46kLm7YnmQRLRNPMzlsUzMFnz-bLNC4nznFLlrkLlLJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvYLz9JqdJnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17218&e=.png"}